@startuml
title Prometheus Hauptpfad: ThreatHint v1 Submission (Baseline 32ca5f1, Development/Testnet-10)

actor Operator
participant "client main.rs\nThreatHintCommand::Submit" as CLI
participant "client network/p2p.rs\nThreatHintSubmitConfig::submit" as Sender
participant "guardian-p2p lib.rs\nGuardianP2p\n(/prometheus/threat-hint/1.0.0)" as P2P
participant "guardian-p2p threat_hint_ingress.rs\nUnixThreatHintIngress::forward" as Ingress
participant "jaeger/threat_hint_service.py\nThreatHintIngressServer" as Service
participant "jaeger/threat_hint_ingress.py\nThreatHintIngress" as Verify
participant "threat-proof main.rs\nCommand::Verify (Subprozess)" as Proof
database "SQLite (owner-only)\nReplay-Ledger + Outbox" as DB
participant "jaeger/threat_hint_adapter.py\nThreatHintAnalyzerAdapter::drain_once" as Adapter
participant "jaeger/analyzer.py\nprocess_verified_threat_hint" as Analyzer

Operator -> CLI : threat-hint submit --config C --hint H
CLI -> Sender : owner-only TOML + canonical hint (<=2048 B)
Sender -> Sender : offline preflight; Beta/Mainnet rejected vor Netzaktivitaet
Sender -> P2P : dial-only QUIC, ein statischer Peer, ThreatHintBytes
P2P -> Ingress : exact canonical bytes (shared global admission cap)
Ingress -> Service : 4-byte AF_UNIX frame (owner-only, peer-UID)
Service -> Verify : schema-v1 reparse, freshness (300 s / 30 s skew)
Verify -> Proof : groth16_kip16_v1, manifest-pinned, shell-free
Proof --> Verify : exit 0/1/2/3 (default: unavailable -> fail-closed)
Verify -> DB : BEGIN IMMEDIATE: replay identities + genau 1 Outbox-Job
Service --> Ingress : ACK accepted/duplicate/rejected/busy (<=384 B, digest-bound)
Ingress --> P2P : ThreatHintAckStatus
P2P --> Sender : remote-local-boundary status
Sender --> CLI : accepted/duplicate/rejected/busy/transport-failure\n(kein Retry, keine Persistenz)

== separater owner-lokaler Drain (GH-74/GH-77; nicht durch submit ausgeloest) ==
Operator -> Adapter : drain_once (<=32 Jobs, lease)
Adapter -> DB : claim pending VerifiedThreatHintJob
Adapter -> Analyzer : VerifiedThreatHint (Hash-Commitment, keine Indikatoren)
Analyzer --> Adapter : AnalysisResult (confidence 0.0, keine Regel, should_submit=false)
Adapter -> DB : mark-delivered (Fehler: Job bleibt pending, spaetere Jobs laufen weiter)
@enduml
